spice
* Diodes
D1 6 4 D_model
D2 2 4 D_model

* Current Sources
I1 6 4 DC I_ES
I2 4 2 DC I_CS

* Voltage-controlled current sources
G1 B 5 B 7 αfI_R
G2 B 7 B 5 αrI_F

* Nodes
* Node 6: Connected to anode of D1, positive terminal of I1
* Node 4: Common node for cathode of D1, anode of D2
* Node 2: Connected to cathode of D2, negative terminal of I2
* Node 5: Connected to positive terminal of G1
* Node 7: Connected to positive terminal of G2
* B: Common ground node